        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# 🦴 Treats\n\nThis is also a complete Twilite graph.\n\nAt different semantic zoom levels the graph can present a glyph, an icon, a summary, or full detail. Expand it and the content behind the compact representation becomes navigable structure."
        }
