        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Rewards carry context\n\nA treat by itself is just an object. In a training relationship it can mean *yes, that behavior*.\n\nThe relationship changes how the content is understood, which is exactly what the parent lesson is trying to show."
